只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Windows Computer Use for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): window-bound screenshot/OCR/click with verification loop, pure-OCR mode, pluggable vision models.","id":"gh:1334460702","install_available":true,"language":"PowerShell","name":"dsh-computer-use-windows","slug":"Altairpaca/dsh-computer-use-windows","topics":["computer-use","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Windows Computer Use for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): window-bound screenshot/OCR/click with verification"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" loop, pure-OCR mode, pluggable vision models."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Computer Use for Windows"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Experimental Windows computer-use bundle for DeepSeek Harness, built around **window-scoped percepti"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"on, text-grounded actions, and post-action verification**."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The repository grew out of a real desktop-automation failure mode: coordinate-only control was britt"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"le when screenshots included unrelated windows, OCR positions drifted, or a click silently landed on"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" the wrong UI state. The implementation therefore treats every action as an observable state transit"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ion rather than a blind coordinate command."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 中文简介：面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 Windows computer-use 实验插件。核心是目标窗口绑定、OCR 文本定位、点击后验证与失败重试；视觉模型是可选项，纯 OCR "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"epSeek Harness 的 Windows computer-use 实验插件。核心是目标窗口绑定、OCR 文本定位、点击后验证与失败重试；视觉模型是可选项，纯 OCR 模式不需要外部 VLM。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Status"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Experimental alpha.** The repository contains a real DSH plugin wrapper (`plugins/index.js`), help"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"er runtime (`helper/cu.ps1`), bundle patch, skill documentation, local health checks, and hosted Win"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"dows static CI. It is suitable for development and controlled testing, but the project does not yet "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"claim production-grade unattended desktop automation."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The remaining release gate is a clean-install / real-DSH validation matrix on representative interac"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"tive Windows configurations."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Design invariants"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Invariant | Why it exists |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Window-scoped coordinates | screenshots, OCR results, and clicks must refer to the same target-win"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"dow coordinate system |\n| Text before coordinates | when text is observable, `click_text` resolves t"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"he target from OCR instead of asking the model to guess pixels |\n| Verify after action | a click is "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"successful only when the expected post-action state can be observed |\n| Retry with evidence | offset"},{"id":"p11s5","text":" retries return the attempted positions and verification result instead of hiding failure |\n| Vision"},{"id":"p11s6","text":" is optional | the deterministic OCR path remains usable without sending screenshots to an external "},{"id":"p11s7","text":"model |\n| Credentials stay external | model/API credentials are read from environment or host creden"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"tial storage, not committed config |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Implemented surface"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| Capability | Current surface |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| `computer_screenshot` | full-screen or target-window screenshots with coordinate metadata |\n| `com"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"puter_ocr` | Windows OCR with word coordinates, filtering, and fuzzy query support |\n| `computer_cli"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ck_text` | OCR locate → click → verify → bounded offset retry |\n| `computer_mouse` / `computer_keybo"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ard` | mouse, drag, scroll, keyboard, and clipboard-oriented input primitives |\n| `computer_window` "},{"id":"p14s5","text":"| enumerate, focus, and resolve target windows |\n| `computer_use_run` | batch action execution throu"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"gh one tool call |\n| `computer_vision` | optional pluggable OpenAI-compatible vision endpoint |\n| `c"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"omputer_calibrate` | DPI / residual calibration support |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The DSH-facing tool registration lives in `plugins/index.js`; the Windows implementation is kept in "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"`helper/cu.ps1` so platform-specific mechanics remain isolated from the host adapter."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Modes"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### OCR-only"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"No screenshot is intentionally sent to a remote vision model in this mode."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Optional vision provider"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The API key is referenced by environment-variable name; it is not stored in the repository configura"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"PI key is referenced by environment-variable name; it is not stored in the repository configuration."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Local interactive smoke check"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Requirements:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Windows 11 recommended;\n- PowerShell 7.4+;\n- Node.js 20+ for the DSH plugin surface;\n- Windows OCR"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" language packs for OCR-dependent workflows."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Run on the **target Windows workstation**:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The script exercises the helper health path and window enumeration. Missing OCR language support is "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"reported as a warning rather than silently treated as available."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"For a direct helper call:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Hosted CI"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"GitHub Actions runs on `windows-latest` and deliberately performs only deterministic checks that are"},{"id":"p32s2","text":" valid on a hosted Windows Server runner:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"1. JavaScript syntax for the DSH plugin wrapper;\n2. PowerShell parser correctness for the helper and"},{"id":"p33s2","text":" diagnostic entry points;\n3. package / bundle / skill entry-point existence."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"The full `scripts/check-health.ps1` path is **not** treated as hosted CI because it depends on Windo"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"ws Runtime/OCR availability and an interactive desktop session. Those properties differ from the tar"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"get Windows workstation and must be recorded separately as release evidence."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Repository map"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Release-readiness work"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Before calling this stable, the project should demonstrate:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- clean installation against a pinned current DSH release;\n- at least one reproducible OCR-only work"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"flow on Windows 11;\n- DPI scaling checks (100% / 125% / 150% where practical);\n- English and Simplif"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"ied Chinese OCR language-pack behavior;\n- explicit failure behavior when the target window disappear"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"s or verification cannot be satisfied;\n- documentation of which actions are deterministic and which "},{"id":"p39s5","text":"depend on a configured VLM."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Safety boundary"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"This software can inject mouse and keyboard input into desktop applications. Use it only on systems "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"and applications you are authorized to operate. Target-window checks reduce accidental interaction w"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"ith unrelated windows but do not make arbitrary desktop automation risk-free."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"If vision is enabled, screenshots may be transmitted to the configured endpoint. Use OCR-only mode w"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"hen screenshots must remain local."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"MIT. See `LICENSE`."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

